lier, more efficient than traditional professional services firms (consultancies, system integrators, agencies etc.). We have received €20 million in Series A financing round.</p><p>Vicos consist of freelancers, SMEs and AI agents. They organize through our AI-driven SaaS platform to act like real companies, competing successfully for large enterprise projects, e.g. ERP introductions or AI transformations. Vicos have proven to be more cost-efficient and to deliver better quality than traditional companies.</p><p>Already, 120+ Vicos with thousands of members work on projects for enterprise clients like BASF, Miele, Siemens or Daimler and many SMEs. They also serve leading professional services firms as subcontractors, including Accenture, Infosys and Capgemini. Forbes and Forrester have named Vicoland as a leading force transforming the market.</p><p>Our certified platform is key to our success. It provides the full digital infrastructure which makes Vicos come true as a new way of organizing human labor and human-agentic interaction. It covers all essential areas end-to-end: marketing, finance, legal, and organization.</p><h2><strong>Why we are looking for you</strong></h2><p>We are scaling our go-to-market, AI-first and human-led: AI takes over the busywork, people build the relationships and make the decisions. For that we look for people with a builder’s mindset: you have already built or significantly contributed to something, you work with AI as naturally as with email, and you want to grow fast. Maybe you want to found your own company one day.</p><p>With us you learn how a disruptive business grows by challenging established practices and offering radically new, superior solutions: from the first contact to the signed contract and the team that delivers. You work on real enterprise deals from the start and take on more responsibility as you grow.</p><h2><strong>What you do</strong></h2><p>• <strong>Expand our business:</strong> Together with our Chief Growth 