s our next phase of growth – and we're looking for someone who wants to build it with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As our <strong>Finance Lead</strong>, you will take end-to-end ownership of our financial operations, laying the financial foundation for a scaling deep-tech hardware company. From accounting, reporting, controlling and treasury to public funding and the financial infrastructure supporting global equipment deliveries, you will play a central role in how QuantumDiamonds grows.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reporting directly to the CEO, you will work closely with our leadership team, investors and external partners, translating business priorities into sound financial decisions and scalable processes.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a hands-on build role, not a position where you simply oversee an established Finance department. You will work with a lean team, take ownership of operational and strategic topics, and actively leverage technology, AI and automation to build an efficient Finance function that scales alongside the business.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're looking for someone who brings strong Finance foundations, sound judgment, and the ambition to take on broader responsibilities as the company grows. You don't need to have done everything before – but you should be excited to figure things out, take ownership, and make things happen.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>Who we are</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Founded in 2022 as a spin-off of TU Munich, QD leverages quantum sensors to rapidly capture three-dimensional current maps within multi-layer chips. Our strong, international team of over 70, including physicists, engineers, data scientists, and other experts, works side by side with major semiconductor manufacturers, supporting chip debugging and accelerating yield analysis. Backed by top-tier deep tech investors, semiconductor experts, and strategic public programs, we have ensured long-term stability, shifting from breakthrough to scale - and shaping the next chapter in chip testing.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>Why join QuantumDiamonds?</strong></h1><h2><strong>Picture this:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Quantum sensors that see <em>inside</em> the most advanced chips on Earth, right where two frontier fields collide.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nobel-Prize physics aimed at real customers with real problems, in production now, not someday.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Physicists, data scientists, and engineers building side by side, turning deep science into tools the industry actually runs on.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An international team that runs at hard problems for fun, where knowledge moves fast and so do you.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Still unsure about why joining us?</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll get to build a company together with a brilliant and welcoming team on a product that has never been done before.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">From Day 1, you'll own your own topics end to end and see the direct impact of your work on how the world sees QuantumDiamonds.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our technology is the cutting edge of tomorrow, starting today and not in 10 years.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll be part of a high-growth company backed by top-tier investors.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Let’s make the invisible visible!</strong></h2><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>What will you do</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own our day-to-day financial operations, including accounting, controlling, financial reporting and compliance, in collaboration with external partners.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive budgeting, forecasting, cash flow planning and liquidity management, providing actionable financial insights across the business.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with the CEO on financing opportunities, including debt financing, fundraising, investor and board reporting.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage the financial aspects of our European Chips Act funding and other public funding programs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Establish scalable financial processes and internal controls that support our manufacturing operations and international growth.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Improve our financial systems and ERP landscape, actively leveraging AI and automation to build an efficient Finance function.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop our lean Finance team and manage relationships with banks, auditors, tax advisors and other external partners.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>What is expected of you</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Several years of broad Finance experience, ideally in a startup, scale-up or growing technology company.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong foundations in accounting, HGB, financial reporting, and controlling.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Practical experience with budgeting, forecasting, liquidity management, and financial planning.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building or improving financial processes, with an interest in AI, automation, and scalable systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A hands-on, entrepreneurial mindset with the ability to take ownership, prioritize, and get things done independently.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong communication skills and confidence partnering with leadership and external stakeholders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent English; German is an advantage.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have:</strong> Experience in hardware or manufacturing, IFRS, debt financing, public funding, or ERP implementation. Previous experience building or developing a small Finance team is also a plus.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>Our benefits</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Mission:</strong> At QD, we’re driven by more than just building great products - we aim to make a lasting difference. Joining us means contributing to meaningful work that goes beyond business as usual.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Impact &amp; growth:</strong> This is an exciting stage of our journey, and your voice matters. You’ll have the chance to shape our culture, influence key decisions, and grow alongside a company that’s scaling fast.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Health &amp; fitness:</strong> With a company-sponsored Wellpass membership, you’ll have access to countless gyms, classes, and wellness offers across Germany to stay healthy and active.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Team &amp; culture:</strong> We believe the best ideas come when we connect outside the office. From regular off-sites to team events, you’ll be part of a collaborative and supportive environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Well-being &amp; balance:</strong> We value rest and recovery. That’s why you’ll enjoy 30 vacation days plus public holidays to recharge and return inspired.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Learning &amp; development:</strong> Your growth is our priority. We provide an annual budget dedicated to courses, conferences, or any resources that help you expand your skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ownership &amp; participation:</strong> As part of our equity program, you’ll directly share in our success and the value we create together.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>About us</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">QuantumDiamonds GmbH, headquartered in Munich, Germany, develops and manufactures semiconductor inspection systems based on quantum sensing. Spun out of the Technical University of Munich in 2022, the company uses nitrogen-vacancy centers in diamond to map electrical current with micrometer precision inside advanced 2.5D and 3D chip architectures. Nine of the world's ten largest semiconductor manufacturers are engaged with QuantumDiamonds, with systems deployed across Europe, the United States, and Asia. The company is investing €152 million to build the world's first production facility for quantum sensing-based semiconductor inspection tools, supported under the European Chips Act.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/quantumdiamonds/finance-lead-munich-223712","tags":["Business"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Munich HQ","created_at":1795686011},{"slug":"account-executive-mid-market-munich-373095","company_name":"remberg","title":"Account Executive Mid-Market (f/m/d)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>At remberg, you’ll help to keep the world running.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Everything that gets produced relies on a maintenance team behind the scenes that keeps the machines, equipment and infrastructure running. We are helping these teams by simplifying their work with modern, agentic maintenance software. At remberg, we are serving clients like Remondis, Würth, Edeka, Rotkäppchen and 300+ more.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Supported by the visionary founders of category-defining businesses such as Celonis, Dash0, UiPath, Personio and Forto, as well as leading investors like Earlybird, Speedinvest, Oxx, Acton, and Fly Ventures, remberg is positioned to be the European category leader for modern, agentic maintenance software.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>WAS DICH ERWARTET</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Als Account Executive Mid-Market bei remberg verantwortest du deine Deals von Anfang bis Ende. Du qualifizierst eingehende Anfragen, führst Demos und Free-Trials durch, gewinnst neue Kunden und baust die Zusammenarbeit nach dem ersten Vertrag weiter aus. Du verkaufst an Unternehmen bis 500 Mitarbeitende, bei denen ohne funktionierende Anlagen nichts läuft: von Fertigung und Lebensmittelproduktion über Logistik und Energieversorgung bis zum Gebäudemanagement und Hotelgewerbe. Du sprichst mit Instandhaltungsleitungen, Werksleitungen und Facility Managern, die genug von Papier und Excel haben. Entschieden wird oft direkt mit der Geschäftsführung. Dich erwarten kurze Sales Cycles, viele Deals parallel und ein Job, bei dem du direkt siehst, wie sich der Arbeitsalltag in der Instandhaltung verändert.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du arbeitest hybrid, mindestens 3 Tage pro Woche in unserem Office in München.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>DEINE AUFGABEN</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Full-Cycle Ownership:</strong> <strong>Ownership:</strong> Du begleitest Deals vom ersten Call bis zur Unterschrift und verantwortest dein Umsatzziel. Pipeline und Forecast in HubSpot sind bei dir immer aktuell.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Inbound-Qualifizierung:</strong> Du qualifizierst eingehende Anfragen schnell und investierst deine Zeit dort, wo echtes Potenzial liegt.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Branchenübergreifender Vertrieb: </strong>Du gewinnst Kunden in ganz unterschiedlichen Branchen, von der Fertigung bis zum Facility Management.