 timelines behind every event, and improve them as we scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Report on what works.</strong> Track attendance, meetings booked, pipeline and cost per event, so we invest more in what drives results.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Be on site.</strong> Set up, run the day and represent Wordsmith with customers and prospects.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What we're looking for</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Some experience in event marketing, event coordination or a similar role at a B2B company or agency.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exceptionally organized. You track the details so nothing slips, even with several events running at once.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confident with vendors, venues and senior attendees.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable working across time zones with colleagues in London and New York.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong with spreadsheets and CRM tools, and you use AI tools to work faster.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Happy to travel regularly, including to the US.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>It would also be great if you have:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with B2B software, legal or professional services events.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run executive dinners or roundtables.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Used a CRM such as Attio, HubSpot or Salesforce to track event leads.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A good eye for design and attendee experience.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How We'll Measure Success</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Events delivered on time and on budget</p><p style=