olicy</u></a> for details on your rights and how to reach us.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/bunch/senior-manager-ceo-office-ma-london-149410","tags":["Enablement"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1795750985},{"slug":"head-of-sales-fund-administration-vc-pe-private-markets-london-235906","company_name":"bunch","title":"Head of Sales | Fund Administration | VC & PE | Private Markets","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.bunch.capital/"><u>bunch</u></a> is building the backbone of private markets. We are enabling next-gen fund operations with one integrated system that combines secure data infrastructure, AI-powered workflows and expert fund services. If you value ownership, growth through real responsibility, and working with a thoughtful, ambitious team, this role might be for you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Your Role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">As <strong>Head of Sales</strong> at bunch, you will strengthen, lead and scale our sales team across key European markets — UK, Luxembourg and Germany. Reporting directly to the Co-Founder, you will turn our high-touch executive commercial motion into a structured, repeatable sales engine across our key European markets.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will lead Account Executives and Commercial Associates selling to sophisticated decision-makers across VC, PE, and alternative asset managers (GPs, CFOs, COOs, and Fund Ops teams). Because our business model combines scalable SaaS capabilities with high-touch fund services, sales cycles are relationship-driven, multi-stakeholder, and often long. This role demands a leader who can combine structured organisation and process building, relentless deal execution and strong