&lt;p&gt;Success in this role comes from a full diary of calls every week, a high share of your shortlists reaching second interview, and close collaboration with hiring managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(71, 215, 172);&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
