&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer to build and operate the digital-asset infrastructure behind Prisma, our event-driven platform that gives internal teams access to custody providers, wallets, and liquidity partners. You’ll focus on how assets move and are held across the platform: wallet and vault integrations, deposit and withdrawal flows, balance tracking and reconciliation, and portfolio and fund management across accounts. You’ll also contribute to related digital-asset projects such as liquidity management, asset collections, and liquidation services, including controls like maker-checker approvals and segregation of duties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
