&lt;li&gt;Work on our internal trading system (Prisma)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on a variety of challenges spanning crypto, trading, fintech, and payment solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully integrate into a large system and spot opportunities for improvements and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype new solutions for complex software problems and implement them for production cloud deployments&lt;/li&gt;
