&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Consultant – Finance Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime | Type: Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower finance leadership through strategic transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is looking for Principal Consultants to join our growing Finance Transformation capability within the Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime (FRRF) practice. You&#39;ll play a key role in helping CFOs, Treasurers and senior finance leaders maximise the value of their finance and treasury functions through operating model redesign, process transformation and strategic technology delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also use approved AI tools, automation and AI-enabled workflows to enhance analysis, accelerate insight generation and improve delivery efficiency. You&#39;ll apply professional judgement, appropriate validation and responsible AI practices to ensure solutions remain effective, transparent and aligned with regulatory and client requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver finance transformation programmes spanning regulatory change, including Basel, IFRS and PRA requirements, finance technology, process optimisation and operating model transformation, identifying opportunities to improve delivery through approved AI tools and automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with CFOs, Treasurers and C-suite stakeholders to implement finance strategies, strengthen controls and optimise regulatory reporting, including ICAAP, ILAAP and Recovery and Resolution Planning (RRP).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define business requirements and manage end-to-end project delivery across finance, treasury and regulatory change initiatives, ensuring appropriate governance, validation and human oversight where AI-assisted tools are utilised.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and implement stress testing frameworks across credit, market and liquidity risk to support regulatory compliance and strategic decision-making, using AI-enabled analysis where appropriate to enhance insight and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with technology teams to embed digital capabilities, automation and responsible AI-enabled solutions into finance processes, architecture and operating models to improve efficiency and business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
