&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape strategic initiatives for CFOs and executive stakeholders, improving controls, efficiency and financial insight across areas such as ICAAP, ILAAP and Recovery and Resolution Planning (RRP).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee regulatory transformation programmes, including Basel, IFRS and PRA requirements, ensuring compliance, operational effectiveness and appropriate governance of AI-enabled solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with technology and data teams to embed automation, cloud, digital capabilities and responsible AI-enabled workflows into finance functions, ensuring appropriate validation, human oversight and auditability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support business growth through client development, leadership of delivery teams and thought leadership, identifying opportunities to apply AI and emerging technologies responsibly to enhance client outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
