ong> We offer life assurance, share schemes, and financial coaching.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Development:</strong> You get a dedicated annual learning allowance to help you level up.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lifestyle:</strong> We have electric car and cycle-to-work schemes, plus season ticket loans.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">We also have award-winning parental leave policies. We're here to support you through the big life moments, from fertility treatments to new additions to the family.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Ready to join a mission that matters? We’d love to chat!</strong></h2><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/fundingcircle/account-executive-outbound-london-496235","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1795740014},{"slug":"head-of-brand-media-london-116459","company_name":"Trainline","title":"Head of Brand Media","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About us</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Trainline, our purpose is to <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.thetrainline.com/terms/sustainability-faqs">empower greener travel choices, connecting people and places.</a> Trainline enables millions of travellers to find and book the best value tickets across carriers, fares, and journey options through our highly rated mobile app, website, and B2B partner channels. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Great journeys start with Trainline 🚄 </strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re Europe’s leading independent rail platform, helping millions of travellers find and book the best-value rail and coach journeys across our app, website and partner channels.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our job is to make the green travel choice the best choice. By building a better train travel experience, we help more people choose rail - creating a positive impact for customers, our business and the planet.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re a team of more than 1,000 Trainliners from over 50 nationalities, working across London, Paris, Barcelona, Milan, Edinburgh and Madrid. Now is a brilliant time to join us and help shape the future of travel.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Introducing the Trainline Media Team 👋</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Trainline is Europe's leading rail and coach platform, and media is one of the biggest levers we have for growing awareness, consideration and bookings across the UK and our international markets. The Head of Media owns our media strategy, planning and investment end to end, leading a high-calibre team across the UK, France, Italy and Spain, and acting as a senior voice alongside Commercial, Marketing and Data Science.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a hands-on leadership role. You'll manage our agency and partner ecosystem, partner with the effectiveness team on measurement standards that prove what's working, and build in-house media capability. You'll set direction and raise the bar across the team, while staying close enough to the detail to step in when it matters.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>In this role as the Head of Media, you will...🚄</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Media strategy and planning</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the global media strategy and the quarterly planning cycle across all markets, balancing brand awareness and performance outcomes</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring structure and consistency to planning processes so markets plan to a common standard while keeping room for local nuance</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage budget allocation, reforecasting and in-flight optimisation as priorities and budgets shift</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Align closely with Brand, Growth, GTM, Creative and Country Managers so media plans reflect business priorities</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sponsorship, partnerships and retail media</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Line-manage the Sponsorship Lead and Sponsorship Executive, owning sponsorship strategy, portfolio and budget, and explore partnership and retail media opportunities with travel, hospitality, events and lifestyle brands</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Creative and brand integration</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Brand Managers and the Creative team from the earliest stage of briefing, so media thinking shapes ideas rather than simply distributing them, and champion creative use of media that makes our work more distinctive and effective</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Finance and governance</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the annual and quarterly media budget forecast, agreeing phasing, sign-off and accruals with Finance</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run a clear reforecasting rhythm with Finance so in-flight changes to budget and allocation are agreed, documented and reflected in the forecast</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Procurement on agency and media-owner contracts, commercial terms, transparency and audit rights</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set governance for approvals, spend tracking and reporting so investment decisions are transparent and auditable</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Agency and partner management</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own relationships with our media agencies, setting clear briefs, SLAs and performance standards, leading agency reviews and pitches, and building direct relationships with media owners (e.g. Google, Meta, TikTok, Spotify, broadcasters, OOH and streaming partners) and platforms to unlock premium inventory and innovationOwn the relationship with our media agencies, setting clear briefs, SLAs, ways of working and performance standards, and holding them to account</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>In-house capability</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead the evolution of in-house media buying, defining what we do ourselves versus through agencies, and scaling the model across markets</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Champion AI and automation in media planning, reporting and operations, and encourage the team to experiment</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Measurement and learning, compliance and brand safety</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Shape a measurement and learning framework with the effectiveness team and Data Science, and make sure media activity meets privacy, consent and brand safety standards across every market</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make sure media activity meets privacy and consent requirements (including GDPR, ePrivacy and cookie consent) in every market, working with Legal, Privacy and Data teams</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Leadership and culture</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead, coach and develop a team of specialists, closing priority capability gaps, building individual development plans, and creating a collaborative, high-trust culture across media, studio, Marketing and Data Science</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We'd love to hear from you if you have...🔍</strong></p><ul style