; Industrialisation</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with engineering teams to validate system integration and overall product performance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support prototype testing, design verification and production readiness.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate testing activities with external suppliers and testing laboratories.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to the definition and improvement of V&amp;V methodologies and processes.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>Documentation &amp; Reporting</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prepare and maintain test plans, procedures and validation reports.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track verification status, test coverage and outstanding technical issues.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure proper documentation and traceability throughout the development lifecycle.</p></li></ul><h2><br />Candidate Profile </h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Master's degree in Systems, Aerospace, Mechanical, Electrical or Software Engineering.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">2–5 years of experience in Verification &amp; Validation, system testing or qualification engineering.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in aerospace, defence, automotive, robotics or complex electromechanical systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong understanding of requirements management, verification methods and test methodologies.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with hardware/software integration and system-level testing.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with environmental testing and qualification processes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with requirements and test management tools</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in Fr