em"></p><h2>About Us</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Veeda AI is building the next generation of multimodal foundation world models for Physical AI. We're a small, fast-moving team of engineers and researchers from leading AI labs, tackling some of the most challenging problems at the intersection of AI, robotics, and embodied intelligence. If you're excited about pushing the boundaries of what's possible with Physical AI, you'll have the opportunity to make an outsized impact from day one.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Responsibilities</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for a proactive and highly organized Office Manager to oversee our Zurich office and support our growing team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a hands-on role combining office management, recruiting coordination, and people operations. You will ensure a welcoming and productive workplace, help deliver a great candidate and employee experience, and support day-to-day operations.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Office &amp; Workplace Operations</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support local leadership with day-to-day administrative and operational needs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage daily office operations, facilities, supplies, vendors, and workplace services.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate office procurement, equipment, maintenance, and administrative expenses.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Organize team events, employee activities, and workplace amenities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Serve as the primary point of contact for office-related matters and proactively improve the workplace experience.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Recruiting &amp; People Operations</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate interviews across teams and time zones, ensuring a smooth candidate experience.</p></li><li><p style="min-