5","company_name":"Tellent","title":"Talent Acquisition Business Partner","description":"<p>As a Talent Acquisition Business Partner, you'll play a key role in attracting and hiring the talent that drives Tellent's growth. You'll own end-to-end recruitment across different business functions, from Product &amp; Engineering to Go-to-Market, partnering with hiring managers to develop effective hiring strategies and deliver a great candidate experience.</p><p>Talent Acquisition is a dedicated function within our wider People Team. You'll work closely with hiring managers, HR Business Partners and other People colleagues to understand business priorities and translate them into recruitment strategies.</p><p>We're looking for an all-round recruiter who combines strong sourcing skills with a genuine business partnering mindset. Someone who isn't afraid to challenge hiring requirements, question assumptions and bring market insights to the table. As internal users of our own products, you'll also collaborate with our Product teams to share feedback and identify opportunities to improve our recruitment tools and experience.</p><h4><strong>Your 12-Month Journey</strong></h4><ul><li><p><strong>During the first 3 months:</strong> Get familiar with our business, teams and recruitment processes. Build relationships with key stakeholders and take ownership of active recruitment processes.</p></li><li><p><strong>Within 6 months:</strong> Independently manage recruitment across multiple functions, develop sourcing strategies and build talent pipelines for current and future hiring needs.</p></li><li><p><strong>After 1 year:</strong> Become a trusted business partner to hiring teams, contribute to talent acquisition strategy and drive continuous improvements across our recruitment processes and tools.</p></li></ul><h4><strong>What You’ll Be Doing</strong></h4><ul><li><p><strong>Own end-to-end recruitment:</strong> Manage the full recruitment lifecycle across different functions, from intake meetings and sourcing to offer management.</p></li><li><p><strong>Partner with the business:</strong> Work closely with hiring managers and HR Business Partners to understand business needs and develop effective hiring strategies.</p></li><li><p><strong>Challenge and advise:</strong> Question hiring requirements, challenge assumptions and bring talent market insights to hiring decisions.</p></li><li><p><strong>Drive proactive sourcing:</strong> Identify and engage active and passive candidates through LinkedIn Recruiter, job boards, referrals and other channels.</p></li><li><p><strong>Build talent pipelines:</strong> Develop and maintain talent pools for current and future hiring needs.</p></li><li><p><strong>Improve how we work:</strong> Monitor recruitment performance, identify opportunities for improvement and collaborate with our Product teams to share feedback as an internal user of Tellent.</p></li></ul><h4><strong>What You Bring</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Several years of experience in Talent Acquisition or recruitment, ideally in an in-house environment.</p></li><li><p>Experience managing end-to-end recruitment across different functions, ideally covering both Product &amp; Engineering and Go-to-Market roles.</p></li><li><p>Experience in a B2B SaaS, technology or fast-growing scale-up environment is a strong plus.</p></li><li><p>Strong sourcing skills and experience building talent pipelines, including engaging passive candidates.</p></li><li><p>Confidence in partnering with and constructively challenging hiring managers and senior stakeholders.</p></li><li><p>A good understanding of talent markets and the ability to translate business needs into realistic hiring strategies.</p></li><li><p>A proactive, hands-on mindset with strong communication and stakeholder management skills.</p></li><li><p>Experience with LinkedIn Recruiter and ATS platforms.</p></li><li><p>Fluent in English; additional languages are a plus.</p></li></ul><h4><strong>What We Offer</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Hybrid working from our canal-side Amsterdam office</p></li><li><p>Diverse and international team environment</p></li><li><p>€1,500 annual learning budget + 2 dedicated learning days</p></li><li><p>Pension plan, wellness perks &amp; commuting/travel reimbursement</p></li><li><p>28 paid holiday days + 2 additional days in 2026</p></li><li><p>Work from anywhere for up to 4 weeks per year</p></li><li><p>Apple MacBook and all the tools you need to succeed</p></li><li><p>€200 home office budget + work-from-home allowance</p></li></ul><h4><strong>About Tellent</strong></h4><p style="text-align:start;">Tellent is a leading Talent Management Suite designed to empower HR &amp; People teams across the entire employee journey. Our all-in-one platform combines an Applicant Tracking System (<strong>Tellent Recruitee</strong>), an intuitive HRIS (<strong>Tellent HR</strong>), and powerful Performance Management software (<strong>Tellent Grow</strong>).</p><p style="text-align:start;">With 250+ team members globally, 7,000+ customers in 100+ countries, and a growing ecosystem of 500+ partners, we help organizations attract, grow, and retain top talent — and we’re just getting started.</p><h4><strong>AI in our recruitment process</strong></h4><p style="text-align:start;">We use our internally developed AI tools to help streamline our recruitment process. However, technology never makes a decision. Every candidate is personally reviewed by our team. Your journey with us is guided by people, supported by tech. Curious about how it works? Read our&nbsp;<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://recruitee.com/ai-statement">AI Statement</a>, check our&nbsp;<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://recruitee.com/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>, or chat with us at&nbsp;<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- style="text-align:start;"><em>If you require accommodations or support during the recruitment process, please let us know — we’re happy to help.</em></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/tellent/talent-acquisition-business-partner-amsterdam-360585","tags":["1. G&A"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1795523482},{"slug":"hr-manager-onderwijs-leiden-93467","company_name":"AV Werving & Selectie","title":"HR Manager Onderwijs","description":"<p><strong>Deze HR functie combineert inhoudelijk advies met coördinatie en verantwoordelijkheid. Als HR adviseur Onderwijs bij Lyceo krijg je de ruimte om inhoudelijk impact te maken én een bredere rol binnen het team te pakken. Je ondersteunt leidinggevenden, begeleidt verzuimtrajecten, verbetert HR processen en coördineert de werkzaamheden binnen het team HR en Salaris. Een veelzijdige volgende stap voor een ervaren HR professional die inhoudelijk sterk is en al ervaring heeft met het begeleiden, coördineren of aansturen van collega's.</strong></p>
<h2>Taken</h2>
<p>Als HR adviseur Onderwijs ondersteun je leidinggevenden bij personele vraagstukken, begeleid je verzuimtrajecten en denk je mee over beleid en organisatieontwikkeling. Tegelijkertijd zorg je voor overzicht en samenhang binnen het team HR en Salaris. Je coördineert de werkzaamheden binnen het team en bent verantwoordelijk voor recruitment, waarbij je ook de recruiter begeleidt en aanstuurt.</p>
<p>Je blijft nadrukkelijk zelf actief in de dagelijkse HR praktijk. De ene dag begeleid je een leidinggevende bij een complex verzuimdossier, de andere dag stem je prioriteiten binnen het team af, bespreek je de voortgang van recruitment of werk je aan nieuw HR beleid. Zo verbind je HR beleid, processen en de dagelijkse praktijk met elkaar. Je kent de dynamiek van de organisatie, weet wat er op de verschillende vestigingen speelt en zorgt ervoor dat het team effectief inspeelt op wat de organisatie nodig heeft.</p>
<p>Kortom, jij pakt de regie bij het:</p>
<ul>
<li>adviseren van leidinggevenden en management over HR en organisatievraagstukken;</li>
<li>begeleiden van verzuimtrajecten, waaronder complexe en langdurige dossiers;</li>
<li>ontwikkelen, implementeren en evalueren van HR-beleid en optimaliseren en borgen van HR-processen;</li>
<li>coördineren van de werkzaamheden binnen het team HR en Salaris, inclusief recruitment, en het begeleiden en aansturen van collega's binnen het team;</li>
<li>goed gevoel voor relevante wet en regelgeving rond arbeidsrecht, verzuim en beloning, en het vermogen om tijdig juridische of fiscale aandachtspunten te signaleren.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Vereisten</h2>
<p><strong>Voor deze vacature neem jij mee:</strong></p>
<p>Je bent een stevige HR professional die zelfstandig werkt, overzicht houdt en gemakkelijk schakelt tussen verschillende gesprekspartners. Je voelt je prettig in een rol waarin je adviseert, zaken voor elkaar krijgt en collega's begeleidt. Daarbij combineer je een proactieve, praktische en resultaatgerichte instelling met een uitstekende beheersing van de Nederlandse taal.</p>
<p>Vink jij deze checklist ook af?</p>
<ul>
<li>hbo werk- en denkniveau en een afgeronde HR-gerelateerde opleiding;</li>
<li>minimaal 3 jaar ervaring als HR adviseur;</li>
<li>voldoende kennis van arbeidsrecht, de Wet verbetering poortwachter en fiscaliteit rond beloningssystematiek;</li>
<li>ervaring met verzuimtrajecten;</li>
<li>affiniteit met het ontwikkelen van beleid en het verbeteren van processen.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Jouw werkgebied</strong></p>
<p>Jouw nieuwe werkplek bevindt zich in Leiden, op tien minuten lopen van Leiden Centraal. Dankzij deze centrale ligging is het kantoor uitstekend bereikbaar met het openbaar vervoer. Vanuit Leiden werk je nauw samen met leidinggevenden, management en jouw directe HR-collega’s. De functie biedt daarmee een centrale uitvalsbasis voor jouw werk binnen de organisatie.</p>
<h2>Benefits</h2>
<p><strong>Als gedreven HR adviseur kun jij rekenen op:</strong></p>
<p>Veel ruimte om zelfstandig te werken en verantwoordelijkheid te nemen bij een organisatie met korte lijnen, waar goede ideeën snel besproken én uitgevoerd kunnen worden. Je komt terecht in een betrokken team waarin samenwerken, kennis delen en eigenaarschap centraal staan. Ook krijg je volop ruimte om jezelf verder te ontwikkelen.</p>
<p>Op basis van een fulltime dienstverband krijg je daarbovenop:</p>
<ul>
<li>een verantwoordelijke functie van 32 tot 40 uur per week</li>
<li>25 vakantiedagen met de mogelijkheid om 5 dagen bij te kopen;</li>
<li>8% vakantiegeld;</li>
<li>een pensioenregeling waarbij Lyceo 6% van de premie betaalt;</li>
<li>reiskostenvergoeding of volledige OV-vergoeding;</li>
<li>een laptop en telefoon;</li>
<li>een fijne werkplek op tien minuten lopen van Leiden Centraal;</li>
<li>volop ruimte voor ontwikkeling, trainingen en doorgroeimogelijkheden;</li>
<li>toegang tot de Lyceo Academie;</li>
<li>Benefits at Work met aantrekkelijke kortingen;</li>
<li>leuke activiteiten via personeelsvereniging Nablijven.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Werken bij Lyceo</strong></p>
<p>Wie werkt bij Lyceo, blijft leren. Lyceo is marktleider in aanvullend onderwijs en helpt jaarlijks duizenden leerlingen met huiswerkbegeleiding, examentrainingen, bijspijkertrajecten en andere onderwijsprogramma’s. Samen met scholen zorgt Lyceo ervoor dat iedere leerling de kans krijgt om het beste uit zichzelf te halen.</p>
<p>Achter deze maatschappelijke missie staat een informele, ambitieuze en snel ontwikkelende organisatie. Korte lijnen, eigenaarschap en initiatief staan centraal. Goede ideeën krijgen de ruimte en beslissingen worden snel genomen. Je werkt binnen een hecht HR-team van twee HR adviseurs, twee HR officers en een Recruiter.</p>
<p><strong>Eén klik verwijderd van jouw nieuwe baan</strong></p>
<p>Gaat jouw hart sneller kloppen van deze vacature en heb je de checklist afgevinkt? Wacht dan niet te lang, want zodra wij een geschikte kandidaat hebben gevonden sluiten we de vacature. Solliciteren doe je simpel en snel via onze solliciteer-button. Vergeet je niet om een up-to-date cv en een gerichte motivatie toe te voegen? Heb je vragen over de vacature? Neem dan contact op met Jamie via telefoonnummer 06-82073897. Misschien spreken we elkaar dan snel!</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/av-werving-selectie/hr-manager-onderwijs-leiden-93467","tags":["Personnel Specialist"],"job_types":["Vast dienstverband (onbepaalde tijd)","manager / supervisor"],"location":"Leiden","created_at":1795514468},{"slug":"strategic-account-executive-nordics-baltics-160968","company_name":"Axon","title":"Strategic Account Executive - Nordics & Baltics","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Market responsibility, sales planning and development of new sales strategies for C-UAS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Creating, managing, and executing sales opportunities against a defined C-UAS quota&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Supporting and expanding existing business relationships, directly with end customers, through strategic partnerships, and via SME resellers and distributors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Identification of trends and development of new market potential and customer segments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Developing and implementing sales and market strategies for the DACH region, with particular focus on Defence, National Security and Public Safety&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Delivering strategies and tactics to maximise the potential for Dedrone solutions through existing Axon relationships, experience and their network, across both commercial and government verticals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Processing inquiries and working closely with the wider EMEA/APAC/US sales, product and development teams on strategic projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Degree in engineering, business studies, or comparable qualification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Manage large scale procurement through Ministry of Defence or Interior and related agencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Successful track record in sales requiring technical explanation (with management responsibility), preferably in the military technology or public safety sector&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to inspire and motivate others&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Mission driven, outcomes focused, collaborative and team-oriented&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Mature, self starter, structured and transparent working style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Strong negotiating skills as well as an engaging and confident appearance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Excellent networking skills and an ability to operate at tactical, operational and strategic levels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Business fluent in written and spoken English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Experienced with CRM systems (Salesforce)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and people of color are less likely to apply to jobs unless they check every box in the job description. If you’re excited about this role and our mission to Protect Life but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification listed here, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above job description is not intended as, nor should it be construed as, exhaustive of all duties, responsibilities, skills, efforts, or working conditions associated with this job. The job description may change or be supplemented at any time in accordance with business needs and conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some roles may also require legal eligibility to work in a firearms environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We collect personal information from applicants to evaluate candidates for employment. You may request access, deletion, or exercise other CCPA rights at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Axon Privacy Web Form&lt;/a&gt;. For more information, please see the Your California Privacy Rights section of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Axon’s mission is to Protect Life and is committed to the well-being and safety of its employees as well as Axon’s impact on the environment. All Axon employees must be aware of and committed to the appropriate environmental, health, and safety regulations, policies, and procedures. Axon employees are empowered to report safety concerns as they arise and activities potentially impacting the environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer that promotes justice, advances equity, values diversity and fosters inclusion. We’re committed to hiring the best talent — regardless of race, creed, color, ancestry, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship status, marital status, disability, gender identity, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances — and empowering all of our employees so they can do their best work. If you have a disability or special need that requires assistance or accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ---------- &lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please note that this email address is for accommodation purposes only. Axon will not respond to inquiries for other purposes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Phishing alert:&amp;nbsp; Axon will never ask you to pay for any part of the hiring process, including training, equipment, or background checks. We do not make job offers via text message, WhatsApp, or instant messaging platforms without a formal interview process.&amp;nbsp; All legitimate job openings are listed on our official careers page at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.axon.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;If you receive a suspicious offer or outreach from an email address that is not ----- or if you are asked for sensitive personal information (bank details, Social Security Number) prematurely, please ignore the message and report it to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/axon/strategic-account-executive-nordics-baltics-160968","tags":["3038 Sales Europe"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1795514120},{"slug":"teamleider-projecten-en-planning-doetinchem-120552","company_name":"FAAC Technologies","title":"Teamleider Projecten en Planning","description":"<p><strong>Introductie</strong></p><p>Ben jij een daadkrachtige leider die energie krijgt van het aansturen van teams én het optimaliseren van processen? Weet jij hoe je structuur aanbrengt, mensen motiveert en projecten succesvol laat verlopen?</p><p>Voor FAAC Technologies Doetinchem zijn wij op zoek naar een <strong>Teamleider Projecten &amp; Planning</strong> die het verschil maakt. Jij zorgt voor overzicht, stuurt op resultaat en tilt het team naar een hoger niveau.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Wat ga je doen / Taken en verantwoordelijkheden</strong></p><p>Als Teamleider Projecten &amp; Planning ben jij verantwoordelijk voor het aansturen van projectleiders en planners en zorg je ervoor dat projecten efficiënt, veilig en succesvol worden uitgevoerd.</p><p>Jouw verantwoordelijkheden:</p><ul><li><p>Aansturen, coachen en ontwikkelen van projectleiders en planners</p></li><li><p>Verdelen van werkzaamheden en bewaken van de voortgang van projecten</p></li><li><p>Structureren en voorzitten van team overleggen</p></li><li><p>Signaleren en oplossen van knelpunten, verstoringen en calamiteiten</p></li><li><p>Toezien op kwaliteit, efficiëntie en naleving van processen</p></li><li><p>Initiëren en implementeren van procesverbeteringen</p></li><li><p>Adviseren van management over strategie en optimalisatie</p></li><li><p>Begeleiden van verzuim en coördineren van verlofplanning</p></li><li><p>Stimuleren van een positieve, resultaatgerichte teamcultuur</p></li><li><p>Bewaken van wet- en regelgeving, inclusief veiligheidseisen (VCA)</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong>Wat bieden wij?</strong></p><p>Bij FAAC krijg je een verantwoordelijke rol met veel invloed binnen een groeiende, technische organisatie.</p><p>Wij bieden jou:</p><ul><li><p>Een uitdagende leidinggevende functie met veel verantwoordelijkheid</p></li><li><p>Een salaris tussen €4.359,45 en €6.198,54 bruto per maand (o.b.v. 40 uur)</p></li><li><p>40 vrije dagen (27 vakantiedagen + 13 ADV-dagen)</p></li><li><p>Een solide pensioenregeling en collectieve verzekeringen</p></li><li><p>Moderne faciliteiten en een professionele werkomgeving</p></li><li><p>Ruimte voor ontwikkeling, opleiding en doorgroei</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Over FAAC Technologies</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;">FAAC Technologies, onderdeel van de wereldwijd opererende <strong>FAAC Group</strong>, is dé specialist in toegangsautomatisering. Van automatische deuren en poorten tot slagbomen en parkeersystemen – wij leveren innovatieve en veilige oplossingen. Bij FAAC werk je in een informele, technische en dynamische omgeving waar samenwerking en klantgerichtheid centraal staan.</p><p style="text-align:start;">De FAAC Group omvat <strong>32 bedrijven in 24 landen</strong>, met <strong>18 fabrieken in 15 landen</strong> en <strong>3 business units</strong>. Dankzij deze internationale schaal ontwikkelen en implementeren wij wereldwijd oplossingen voor personen- en voertuigenverkeer, met een sterke focus op kwaliteit, veiligheid en duurzaamheid</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p><strong>Wie ben jij</strong></p><p>Jij bent een sterke leider die structuur brengt en mensen in beweging krijgt. Je schakelt moeiteloos tussen operatie en strategie en weet hoe je resultaten behaalt.</p><p>Jij bent:</p><ul><li><p>Coachend en motiverend richting je team</p></li><li><p>Resultaatgericht en besluitvaardig</p></li><li><p>Sterk in plannen, organiseren en prioriteren</p></li><li><p>Communicatief vaardig en overtuigend</p></li><li><p>Proactief en continu gericht op verbetering</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong>Wat breng je mee?</strong></p><ul><li><p>HBO werk- en denkniveau</p></li><li><p>3 tot 5 jaar ervaring in een leidinggevende rol</p></li><li><p>Ervaring binnen installatietechniek of een vergelijkbare technische omgeving (pré)</p></li><li><p>Kennis van IT-systemen en interne processen</p></li><li><p>Financieel en analytisch inzicht</p></li><li><p>In het bezit van een VCA-VOL certificaat en rijbewijs B</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong>Solliciteren</strong></p><p>Klaar om jouw leiderschap in te zetten en impact te maken binnen FAAC?</p><p>Solliciteer direct en laat zien hoe jij projecten én teams naar een hoger niveau tilt. Wij kijken uit naar jouw reactie!</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/faac-technologies/teamleider-projecten-en-planning-doetinchem-120552","tags":["Installatie","Projecten en Planning"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Doetinchem, Gelderland, Nederland","created_at":1795512700},{"slug":"analytics-engineer-amsterdam-343474","company_name":"Talk360","title":"Analytics Engineer","description":"<p><strong>The Challenge</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW61512950 BCX0">Talk360 connects more than 6 million people worldwide every year, and we rely on data we can trust. We have built the foundations of a modern data platform, and now we are looking for an Analytics Engineer to carry the build forward and make that data work for every team.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW61512950 BCX0" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW61512950 BCX0">You will be a driving force in how Talk360 works with data, spotting where the numbers disagree, helping decide what the right definition is, and building the models that settle it. As the foundations mature, the role might lean further towards analytics, and we will shape that together.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW61512950 BCX0" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW61512950 BCX0">Our current tech includes:</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW61512950 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61512950 BCX0">Data warehouse: BigQuery</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW61512950 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61512950 BCX0">Ingestion: Stitch</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW61512950 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61512950 BCX0">Transformation: dbt Cloud</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW61512950 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61512950 BCX0">Visualisation: Omni, replacing Tableau and QuickSight</p></li></ul><p><strong><br>What you’ll do</strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW262602949 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW262602949 BCX0"><strong>Data Modelling &amp; Pipelines:</strong> Build and maintain scalable, reliable data models that expose high-quality data for analysis and reporting. Decide what each new data source needs and model it for the warehouse, working with Tech, who own our infrastructure and ingestion.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW262602949 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW262602949 BCX0"><strong>Source of Truth:</strong> Grow our dbt project with new, tested and documented models, keeping one agreed definition for every metric. You will be extending and improving a codebase with its own conventions, not starting from a blank page.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW262602949 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW262602949 BCX0"><strong>Automation:</strong> Replace manual routines and hand-built reports with reliable, automatic reporting that teams can check and trust.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW262602949 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW262602949 BCX0"><strong>Stakeholder Collaboration:</strong> Work closely with teams across the business to understand what they need, challenge it where it helps, and translate it into technical solutions that enable reliable self-serve data for decision making.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW262602949 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW262602949 BCX0"><strong>Quality &amp; Governance:</strong> Set the standards and conventions that keep the warehouse maintainable as we grow, and build the monitoring and alerting that catches data quality issues before they reach the business.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW262602949 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW262602949 BCX0"><strong>AI-Ready Data:</strong> Name, describe and define our data clearly and consistently, so that colleagues and AI tools can ask questions of it and get the right answer.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW262602949 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW262602949 BCX0"><strong>Champion Data Culture:</strong> Champion the use of data to optimise business performance, coach colleagues to explore it themselves in Omni, and bring fresh analytical ideas to the table.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Working with AI</strong></p><p><span style="color:#5a5f72">AI is part of how we work every day, and it will be part of your role. We expect you to use AI tools to write and review SQL and dbt code, draft tests and documentation, and speed up investigation, and to check what they produce with a critical eye. You are accountable for the quality of what you ship, however it was written.</span><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>The Team</strong></p><p><span style="color:#5a5f72">You will report to Rianna, our Head of Data, and work with Max (Data Insights) as part of our small Data team of three on day-to-day modelling priorities. You will work with the Tech team, who own our data infrastructure and ingestion, and partner directly with stakeholders across the business.</span><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p> <br> <p><strong>Who you are</strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW231096886 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW231096886 BCX0">You have owned analytics engineering work end to end.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW231096886 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW231096886 BCX0">You have solid SQL and dbt experience, including extending and maintaining an existing dbt project as well as building new models (Cloud or Core).</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW231096886 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW231096886 BCX0">You are comfortable designing data models from ambiguous or undocumented business logic, not just working from an existing spec.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW231096886 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW231096886 BCX0">You see yourself as a strategic partner to the business who wants to understand the underlying question, and you can clearly communicate the impact of your technical work in plain language.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW231096886 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW231096886 BCX0">You use AI tools in your analytics work and you have good habits for checking what they produce.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW231096886 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW231096886 BCX0">You write tests and documentation with every model, and you keep an eye on warehouse cost and on how sensitive data is handled.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW231096886 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW231096886 BCX0">You are familiar with Git fundamentals. We use dbt Cloud for orchestration and deployment, so we do not require deep pipeline engineering.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>How we hire</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW196965695 BCX0">There are four stages:</p><ul><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196965695 BCX0">30-minute call with our recruiter.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196965695 BCX0">60-minute conversation with the hiring manager.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196965695 BCX0">75-minute case study, done in our office with colleagues from across the business. There is nothing to prepare and no take-home task.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196965695 BCX0">30-minute conversation with a senior leader.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>What we have for you</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Competitive compensation</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>80,000 - 90,000 euros per year all-in gross</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Learning and growth</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>€1,500 annual personal development budget, plus access to company-wide training sessions to keep learning and evolving.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Time to recharge</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>25 vacation days&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Option to swap two public holidays per year for days that better reflect your culture or beliefs&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Recharge Fridays, unlocked when team targets are met (we’ll tell you more during the interview)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Work from anywhere</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>As a global and diverse team, we encourage you to work from another city or country for up to 2 weeks per year, gain fresh perspectives and spark new ideas.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>A team you’ll actually want to be part of</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>Weekly team lunch every Thursday&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Regular team moments and outings&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>An international and diverse team, with colleagues from the Netherlands, South Africa, Nigeria, Suriname, Turkey, Egypt, Kenya, Ukraine and beyond&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Set up for success</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>Company laptop and all the tools you need to do your best work&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Monthly phone allowance and commuting allowance&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>An environment to grow and make impact</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>A collaborative environment where you can learn from others, take ownership, and contribute to a meaningful mission.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>About Talk360&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:start;">Talk360 has grown into a global communications platform connecting more than 6 million people worldwide. We've successfully spun off our payments business into NjiaPay, stepped into the gap left by Skype, and built a profitable, sustainable business.&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:start;">We're now expanding beyond our own consumer app through our SDK, enabling partners to integrate Talk360's calling infrastructure directly into their own products.&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;">Our ambition is simple:<u> </u><strong>To become the world's most trusted way to call any phone number.</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;">&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:start;">Here’s what our users say:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:start;"><em>“I like Talk360 because it saves me a lot of money. I used to call from Zimbabwe for 15 rands a minute. Talk360 came to the rescue. Now I can call my mother for hours.” — Google Play, South Africa ★★★★★</em>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:start;"><em>“Talk360 is a simple and reliable app for cheap international calls. It works even if the receiver has no internet, offers good call quality, and has transparent pricing.” — Google Play, United States ★★★★★</em>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:start;"><em>“It is a flawless experience with no hustles at all and the tariffs are more than just fair.” — Trustpilot, United Kingdom ★★★★★</em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/talk360/analytics-engineer-amsterdam-343474","tags":["Product and Tech"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1795512700},{"slug":"senior-full-stack-engineer-amsterdam-277699","company_name":"Talk360","title":"Senior Full-Stack Engineer","description":"<p class="Paragraph SCXW210692716 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#1A1A1A">The Challenge&nbsp;<br></span></strong><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Much of what Talk360 users see and touch is built with web technology - onboarding, buying credit, Shop360 and calling in the browser - on top of a Ruby on Rails platform. Every change you ship reaches hundreds of thousands of people in more than 190 countries, often on older devices, limited data plans and unreliable networks. For them, a checkout that won’t load isn’t a UX inconvenience. It’s a call home that doesn’t happen.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW210692716 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Talk360 is profitable, our B2B2C platform is expanding, and we’re building an AI-first engineering team. We’re looking for a Senior Full Stack Engineer with frontend as their home base: someone who builds excellent web experiences and is just as willing to go into our Rails backend to make them work end-to-end.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#1A1A1A">What You'll Do&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Lead on frontend&nbsp;</span></strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Build and improve our web experiences in React: onboarding, buying credit, Shop360 and account features&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Help evolve our web dialer and the web side of our embedded calling product, used by partners to bring Talk360 calling into their own platforms&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Shape frontend architecture and technical direction, working closely with the Tech Lead and the rest of the team&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Bring our design system to the web with consistent, accessible components across all our apps&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Own frontend quality: performance on low-end devices and slow networks, releases, monitoring and error tracking&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Work across the stack&nbsp;</span></strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Take features end-to-end: build the Rails API and data model your frontend needs, instead of waiting for it&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Contribute to our Ruby on Rails platform, the backend behind our mobile apps, web apps and partner integrations&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Strengthen automated testing, CI/CD and tooling so we can ship often and with confidence&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Raise the level of the team through technical designs, code reviews and sharing what you know&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Learn from customers, build AI-first&nbsp;</span></strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Ship features and experiments on the journeys that matter most to our users, from first open to buying credit&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Use data, error reports and user feedback to find and fix what hurts users most&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Work with Product and Design before implementation to shape solutions, not just execute them&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW172535460 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW172535460 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Use AI tooling throughout your workflow to raise quality and speed, and help shape how we work as an AI-first engineering team&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW177013633 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#1A1A1A">The Team&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW177013633 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">You'll be working alongside Isah (Frontend), Oleg (Full Stack), Alex (Backend), Yahaya (VoIP and Data Platform), Igor (iOS and Mobile Lead), David (Android), and Tom (Tech Lead). The wider tech team you'll collaborate with includes Michal &amp; Ali (QA). On the product side, you'll work closely with Quintin and Kseniia (Product) and Cameron (Design).&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW177013633 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Talk360 is a lean company, around 30 people globally, which means you'll interact regularly across functions: ops, support, data, and marketing. That cross-functional visibility is one of the things that makes the work here interesting and your impact visible.&nbsp;</span></p> <br> <p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Tech Stack&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Must have&nbsp;</span></strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">React and TypeScript in production&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Modern HTML and CSS, responsive and mobile-first&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Web performance: making apps fast on low-end devices and slow networks&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Solid backend experience with Ruby on Rails: API design and relational databases (we use MySQL)&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Experience owning production applications end-to-end, from technical design to operations&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Experience implementing automated tests (unit, component and end-to-end) and working with CI/CD&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Git&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Actively using AI throughout your development workflow&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Nice to have&nbsp;</span></strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Building or maintaining a design system or component library&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">WebRTC, VoIP or real-time communication&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Payment and checkout flows&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Infrastructure experience: AWS (ECS, RDS), Docker, infrastructure as code&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Observability and analytics tooling (Sentry, Graylog, Mixpanel or similar)&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#1A1A1A">Who You Are&nbsp;</span></strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">You're a generalist with a frontend heart: you care about what users see and touch, and you'd rather own a problem end-to-end than stay in one layer of the stack.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">You naturally take ownership without waiting for permission.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">You enjoy solving hard technical problems while thinking about the bigger picture.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">You care deeply about software craftsmanship and user experience.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">You can explain the trade-offs behind your technical choices.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">You enjoy partnering with product teams and learning directly from customer feedback.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">You share what you know and help others improve and become stronger.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">You're pragmatic. You know when perfection matters and when shipping matters more.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">You're excited about building software that genuinely changes people's lives.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW151462866 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">You're based in or around Amsterdam and able to come to our office two to three times a week.</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW151462866 BCX0"><span style="color:#1A1A1A">&nbsp;</span></p></li></u