sertief:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Je vindt het leuk om via de telefoon mensen te overtuigen en weet klanten op een enthousiaste manier in beweging te krijgen;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Creatief brein:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Een pakkende mail schrijven, een actie bedenken of een proces verbeteren? Jij ziet overal kansen;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Teamplayer:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Bij ons staat samenwerken centraal, want samen zorgen we ervoor dat zoveel mogelijk mensen op de fiets stappen. Daarnaast maken we er samen het leukste van op kantoor. Met jou samenwerken is een feestje, omdat de gezelligheid en het teamgevoel ervan afspat.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Wat bieden wij jou?</strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Naast een rol waarin je écht het verschil maakt voor jouw eigen klanten, bieden we je natuurlijk nog veel meer:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Volledige verantwoordelijkheid:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Geen koffiehaal-stage, maar jouw eigen MKB-segment én de ruimte om mee te denken over onze Customer Success-strategie;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Een jong, ambitieus team waarin veel ruimte is voor gezelligheid en persoonlijke groei;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Een mooie stagevergoeding van </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">€500 per maand</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> (o.b.v. fulltime) en </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">6 vakantiedagen</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> (o.b.v. een half jaar);</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Elke dag een </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">verzorgde lunch</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> op kantoor met je collega’s;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">De mogelijkheid om mee te doen aan </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Pon Fit</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> (hét gezondheidsprogramma van Pon) en je te ontwikkelen via onze </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Winter- en Summerlabs</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Ambitie om na je stage te blijven? Geen probleem! Je stapt in op een geweldig moment om mee te groeien met de organisatie.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Solliciteren zonder gedoe!</strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Wij geloven niet in lange, stoffige motivatiebrieven. Overtuig ons liever op jouw manier! Klik op de sollicitatieknop en stuur je CV mee met een </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">korte pitch (max. 5 zinnen)</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> waarin je vertelt hoe jij een bedrijf van 35 medewerkers enthousiast maakt om op de fiets te stappen. Liever een kort spraakbericht of video sturen? App hem direct naar Siebe!</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Heb je eerst nog een vraag? Bel of app Siebe Reinders (Customer Success Manager) op </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">+316 33 01 30 14</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> of mail naar </span><strong><span ----- style="color:#000000">.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Sollicitatieproces:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> We houden het lekker snel. Jouw sollicitatie bestaat uit één kennismakingsgesprek met Siebe of Joep (beide Customer Success Manager).</span></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/lease-a-bike/stagiair-accountmanagement-customer-success-mkb-amersfoort-311804","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Amersfoort, Utrecht, Nederland","created_at":1795501881},{"slug":"founding-account-executive-benelux-advertising-brands-agencies-platforms-amsterdam-143578","company_name":"Higgsfield","title":"Founding Account Executive, Benelux — Advertising (Brands, Agencies, Platforms)","description":"<h2><strong>Why work at Higgsfield AI?</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're the fastest-scaling generative AI company in history, hitting $1B in annual revenue run rate, 30M+ users worldwide, and powering 390 of Fortune 500 brands. We're building at the absolute frontier of AI-powered video creation and next-generation creative tools. Joining Higgsfield means becoming part of a high-impact team shaping the future of AI-native experiences, at a company that isn't just moving fast, but rewriting what fast looks like.<br /></p><h2><strong>The role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Higgsfield is opening enterprise sales in Europe. You will own enterprise revenue in France and the Benelux (Belgium, the Netherlands and Luxembourg), across two verticals. The first is advertising: brands, agencies and ad platforms. The second is video production: production companies, studios and post-production houses. You also pick up gaming accounts in the region. This is a proactive hunting role. You find the accounts, open the conversations, run the deals and close them yourself.<br /></p><h2><strong>What you will do</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Win new enterprise customers.</strong> Source, run and close multimillion deals with large advertisers, digital-first brands and agency groups.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own the advertising vertical.</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Brands: direct contracts with marketing and performance teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Agencies: enterprise packages for creative, production and media agencies.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Platforms: partnerships and integrations with ad and marketing platforms.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own the video production vertical.</strong> Source and close enterprise deals with production companies, film and TV studios and post-production houses. You also cover gaming publishers and developers in the region.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Run complex deals.</strong> Work with marketing, performance, creative, procurement, legal and security teams on the customer side. Sales cycles run 6–12 months.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Turn pilots into annual contracts.</strong> Agree a paid pilot with clear success criteria and convert it into a yearly commitment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Share customer feedback.</strong> Tell product and leadership what customers ask for, what blocks deals and what competitors offer.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Enterprise AE experience.</strong> 4+ years as a B2B Enterprise Account Executive in a closing role, managing the full sales cycle. You have carried a multimillion annual new-business quota and met or exceeded it in most years.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Deals of $1M+ ARR.</strong> You have personally closed deals of $1M+ ARR in the last three years and can describe them in detail: who signed, how long the deal took, and what procurement and legal required.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Complex sales.</strong> Experience with 6–12 month sales cycles and several decision-makers, including C-level and VP-level buyers. You have negotiated enterprise contracts yourself and taken them through procurement, legal and security reviews.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Pipeline and forecasting.</strong> You build most of your pipeline through your own outbound, forecast accurately and keep the CRM up to date.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Agency or brand-side experience.</strong> You have worked on the agency side or the brand side. You understand the full marketing budget stack: how spend is split across media, creative, production and technology, who controls each budget line, and how brands, agencies, ad platforms and measurement providers work together.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Languages.</strong> Fluent French and English, written and spoken, at the level needed to negotiate and close enterprise contracts. Dutch is a major advantage.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>France and Benelux.</strong> Based in Paris, Amsterdam or Brussels, with the right to work in the EU and existing relationships with decision-makers at advertisers and agency groups in France, Belgium, the Netherlands and Luxembourg.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Skills</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Proactive hunting.</strong> You map the market, go after target accounts yourself and build your own pipeline. You do not rely on inbound leads.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Stakeholder management.</strong> You manage several decision-makers in one deal at the same time.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Commercial skills.</strong> You can put together an offer with seats, usage commitments and a pilot.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Agency knowledge.</strong> You understand agency economics and how holding groups buy at group, network and production-unit level.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Partnerships.</strong> You can run a platform integration deal together with a Solutions Engineer.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Product knowledge.</strong> You run your own demos in Higgsfield and use AI tools in your daily work.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Nice to have</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience selling generative AI, creative automation or video technology.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Background in performance marketing: creative testing, attribution, and the Meta, Google and TikTok ad platforms.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience selling to video production companies, studios or gaming publishers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least one partnership or integration deal closed with a platform.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience as an early sales hire at a fast-growing company.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>How we work</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Overlap with US hours.</strong> You will work with our US Enterprise team and company leadership, so part of your working day overlaps with US time zones.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Local hire.</strong> You are based in the region and meet customers in person in Paris, Amsterdam, Brussels and Luxembourg.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>The deal</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive base salary in USD.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Equity participation through the company's stock option program.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Remote in Europe, with regular travel across the region and to Almaty.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our GTM team works six days a week and overlaps with US hours. Expect the same pace wherever you are based.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Full-time position.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Opportunity to become the cornerstone of Higgsfield's European sales engine.</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/higgsfield/founding-account-executive-benelux-advertising-brands-agencies-platfo