ed tape.</span><br></p><h2><strong><span style="color:#000000">This role is for you if</span></strong></h2><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You've built several complete products and you'd enjoy showing them to us.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You like open-ended problems, and you'd rather work out what to build than be handed a spec.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You enjoy problems that are hard to think through, and you can point to one you cracked.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You get excited about the end result, not just the code.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">AI has changed what you dare to build: you ship faster, and you take on projects you’d never have started alone.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You want real influence in a mid-sized company with a large customer base and very little red tape.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><h2><strong><span style="color:#000000">It's probably not for you if</span></strong></h2><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You prefer to stay in one layer of the stack.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You want a detailed spec or a clear list of tasks before you start.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You're still trying AI out rather than building with it every day.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><h2><strong><span style="color:#000000">Where and when you work</span></strong></h2><p><span style="color:#000000">The role is fully remote, and most of the stakeholders and peers work Central European hours. Nobody sets your schedule, but we'd like around six hours of overlap with the team on a normal day. In practice that works best if you live within about two hours of CET.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h2><strong><span style="color:#000000">Show us what you've built</span></strong></h2><p><span style="color:#000000">When you apply, poi