nden wereldwijd. We hebben sterke productmerken binnen de professionele en consumentengroeimarkten, handelend onder de namen BVB Substrates, Kekkilä Professional, Brill Substrates, BVB Landscaping, Kekkilä, Hasselfors Garden, Terra Brill, Jardino en Florentus. Samen met onze klanten groeien we voor een betere toekomst. Kekkilä-BVB is onderdeel van Neova Group. </em><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="http://www.kekkila-bvb.com">www.kekkila-bvb.com</a><em>.</em></p><p><br>Wij zijn op zoek naar een&nbsp;<strong>Customer Service Teamleider </strong>voor ons internationale Customer Service team in De Lier.<br><br>Binnen onze Business Area Global exporteren we momenteel producten uit zes verschillende fabrieken naar 88 landen wereldwijd. Ons klantenbestand is divers en varieert van distributeurs tot eindtelers, van kleine bedrijven tot grote organisaties, en omvat zowel EU- als niet-EU-markten. Deze diversiteit vereist dat het Global Customer Service-team een zeer dynamisch bestelproces beheert. Als teamleider binnen BA Global Customer Service speel je een sleutelrol in dit proces. Je bent verantwoordelijk voor de dagelijkse coördinatie van het Global Customer Service-team, het begeleiden en ondersteunen van teamleden, het verbeteren van workflows en het beheren van projecten die de efficiëntie verhogen en continue ontwikkeling binnen de klantenservice stimuleren.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wat ga je doen?</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Coördineren en aansturen van de dagelijkse werkzaamheden van het wereldwijde klantenserviceteam voor orderontvangst, waarbij wordt gezorgd voor een nauwkeurige en tijdige verwerking van de exportorders en verzendingen.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Optimaliseren van klantenserviceprocessen in nauwe samenwerking met de lijnmanager om te zorgen voor efficiënte workflows en gebruik van Salesforce en andere gerelateerde tools.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Nauwe samenwerking met het CS Global-documentteam om te zorgen voor naleving van documentvoorschriften.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Proactief identificeren van verbeteringsmogelijkheden en oplossen van problemen.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Verzamelen en delen van inzichten over marktsituaties.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Deelnemen aan en ondersteunen van dagelijkse klantenservicewerkzaamheden.</p></li></ul> <br> <p><strong>Jij brengt mee:</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je bent klantgericht en begrijpt hoe je uitzonderlijke ondersteuning kunt bieden aan zowel interne als externe stakeholders.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"> Je hebt ervaring met (complexe) orderafhandeling en planning en organisatie. Daarnaast heb je een grondige kennis van exportprocedures.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Kennis van internationale handel en regelgeving is een pré.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je hebt ervaring en/of algemene kennis van exportdocumentatie.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je beschikt over uitstekende organisatorische vaardigheden en bent goed in het stellen van prioriteiten. Daarnaast heb je ervaring met het samen met een team aansturen van dagelijkse werkzaamheden.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je hebt ervaring met projectmanagement en een proactieve instelling ten aanzien van continue procesverbetering.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je hebt goede IT-vaardigheden en bent bereid om nieuwe dingen en systemen te leren.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je spreekt en schrijft vloeiend Nederlands &amp; Engels, andere talen zijn een pré.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">De persoon die wij zoeken heeft ervaring met internationale exportactiviteiten, logistiek, documentverwerking en klantenservice. Daarnaast hechten wij waarde aan ervaring met het gebruik van ERP- en/of CRM-systemen en algemene kennis van de internationale handels- en logistieke sector. Het belangrijkste is echter de bereidheid om je te ontwikkelen en een enthousiaste houding.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wat krijg je ervoor terug?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Als je bij ons team komt, word je onderdeel van een dynamische en wereldwijd groeiende organisatie. Je krijgt de kans om samen te werken met getalenteerde collega's met verschillende achtergronden, wat zorgt voor een samenwerkingsgerichte en ondersteunende werkomgeving. Samen streven we naar uitmuntendheid en stimuleren we innovatie in onze branche.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Daarnaast bieden wij:</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Een contract voor 12 maanden, met uitzicht op een vaste aanstelling</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Een uitdagende functie in een dynamische en internationale omgeving</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Mogelijkheden voor professionele ontwikkeling en groei</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Een competitief salaris en aantrekkelijke secundaire arbeidsvoorwaarden zoals:</p><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Premievrij pensioen</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">24 vakantiedagen</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">8% vakantiegeld (uitgekeerd in mei en november)</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Hybride werken</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Mogelijke deelname aan collectiviteit van DSW zorgverzekeringen</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Mogelijke deelname aan een WIA-hiaat verzekering</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Gratis fruit op het werk</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Sporten met fiscaal voordeel</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Een bonusregeling o.b.v. onze bedrijfs- (en individuele) doelstellingen</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Een gezellige en actieve personeelsvereniging (vrijwillig)</p></li></ul></li></ul><p><br>Onze kernwaarden zijn “Focus on customer success, Achieving together, Courage to renew and Trust through respect”.</p><p><br><em>Herken jij jezelf in deze functie, of ben jij toe aan de volgende stap in jouw carrière? En kan jij je vinden en onze kernwaarden? Dan ontvangen we graag jouw motivatie en CV!</em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Mocht je naar aanleiding van deze vacature vragen hebben? Dan kunnen deze vragen gesteld worden aan Stefan Dijkshoorn</p><p>(<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- +31 6 21659569) of wanneer er vragen zijn over het sollicitatieproces, aan HR (<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ----------<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/neova-group/customer-service-teamleider-global-export-de-lier-292277","tags":["Kekkilä-BVB"],"job_types":["Entry","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"De Lier, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1795480276},{"slug":"inside-account-executive-smb-mea-existing-customers-amsterdam-62478","company_name":"Jamf","title":"Inside Account Executive | SMB MEA | Existing customers","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Jamf, we believe in an open, flexible culture based on respect and trust. Our track record and thriving work environment all stem from the freedom we grant ourselves to get the job done right. We take pride in helping tens of thousands of customers around the globe succeed with Apple.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The secret to our success lies in our connectivity, while operating with a high degree of flexibility. Work-life balance remains our priority while feeling connected is important to maintain our strong culture, achieve our goals, and thrive as #OneJamf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do at Jamf:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Inside Account Executive is a key member of the EMEIA sales team, helping existing customers and channel partners understand how they can make the management and the security of their Apple devices robust and easy. The role works with the extended sales team to hit individual targets as well as contributing to the overall MEA sales goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role is offered as hybrid, with the expectation to be in the office in Amsterdam Zuid 3 days per week. We are only able to accept applications for those based in the NL and have sponsorship to live and work in the NL #LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you can expect to do this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate regularly with a defined list of existing accounts throughout the year to identify areas of need for business growth and new solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own on-time renewal for your entire SMB customer portfolio; consistently meet or exceed retention rate targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively engage customers 90–120 days ahead of renewal to understand health, flag risks, and secure commitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand customer business needs and schedule technical demonstrations or face to face meetings with SE as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and qualify upsell and cross-sell opportunities within the existing customer base by aligning Jamf solutions to customer business needs and industry insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute campaigns to drive traffic to online and in-person events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enter new Opportunities and related information into SalesForce.com to document and manage sales activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop well-rounded understanding of JAMF sales&amp;nbsp;philosophy, market and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know how to position JAMF Software solutions against competitor offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately process customer transactions such as price quotations and purchase orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow understanding of and ability to explain business value of JAMF Software solutions to prospects and existing customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for leading and closing sales opportunities for the Strategic Commercial team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performs all job responsibilities in alignment with the core values,&amp;nbsp;mission and purpose of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adheres to the highest moral, ethical and legal standards to deliver an environment that promotes respect, innovation and creativity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports and promotes a positive, inclusive workplace one in which the talents and strengths of our increasingly diverse workforce are welcomed, further developed and manifested in our work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional working proficiency in English is required and Arabic is preferred but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2+ years of experience in a sales, business or entrepreneurial role (required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General Experience selling in both direct and indirect (channel) models (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General Experience navigating and negotiating legal agreements (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General Experience in software sales within high-growth technology companies (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and coordinate well with other team members that are remote&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interact effectively with prospects and customers via phone and email&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance areas of responsibility across multiple territories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10% travelling expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY AND PRIVACY REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in ongoing security training is mandatory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established security protocols will be adhered to, sensitive data will be handled responsibly, and data protection practices are followed, including understanding relevant privacy regulations and reporting breaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acknowledging the Jamf Code of Conduct, where applicable security and privacy policies can be found, is a requirement of all roles at Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Why Jamf?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;Named a 2025 Best Companies to Work For by U.S. News.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;Named a 2025 Newsweek America’s Greatest Workplaces for Gen Z&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;Named one of Forbes Most Trusted Companies in 2024&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;Named a 2024 Newsweek America’s Greatest Workplaces for Parents &amp;amp; Families&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;Named a 2024 PEOPLE Companies That Care by PEOPLE® and Great Place To Work®&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;We offer a clear and defined sales career path. Our main goal is to help you successfully step into our Account Executive role, but there are many ways to advance your career at Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;We train and then we give you the room to grow. Our Jamfs can explore the vertical career path, as well as the horizontal, to discover new interests and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;You don’t have to be a techie to be a Jamf. Our best-in-class sales focused Bootcamp training provides you with the technical and product knowledge required to confidently talk with customers about Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;We set achievable targets, help each other out, and share best practices across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;You will have the opportunity to make a real and meaningful impact for more than 75,000 global customers with the best Apple device management solution in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What it means to be a Jamf?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are a team of free-thinkers, can-doers, and problem-crushers. We value humility and the relentless pursuit of knowledge. Our culture flows from a spirit of selflessness and relentless self-improvement - driving both personal growth and collective progress throughout our company. We unite around common goals while respecting personal approaches, believing that fulfilled individuals create a thriving, vibrant workplace.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our aim is simple: hire exceptionally good people who are incredibly good at what they do and let them do it. We provide the support and resources to let everyone be their authentic, best selves at work, at rest, and at play. We are committed to supporting the continual improvement of Apple in the workplace, the organizations that rely on them and the people who keep it all running smoothly.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above it all, waves our banner of #OneJamf – and the knowledge that when we stand together, we accomplish so much more than we could alone. We seek individuals who share this unwavering journey toward growth to join us in our quest for constant improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does Jamf do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Jamf extends the legendary Apple experience people enjoy in their personal lives to the workplace. We believe the experience of using a device at work or school should feel the same, and be as secure as, using a personal device.&amp;nbsp;With Jamf, customers are able to confidently automate Mac, iPad, iPhone and Apple TV deployment, management, and security – anytime, anywhere – to protect the data and applications used by employees in the workplace, students learning in the classroom, and streamline communications in healthcare between patients and providers.&amp;nbsp;More than 2,500 Jamf strong worldwide, we are free-thinkers, can-doers, and problems crushers who are encouraged to bring their whole selves to work each and every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get social with us and follow the conversation at #OneJamf&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Jamf is committed to creating an inclusive &amp;amp; supportive work environment for all candidates and employees. Candidates with disabilities or religious beliefs are encouraged to reach out if they need additional support or alternative options to our recruiting processes to accommodate their disability or religious belief. If you need an accommodation, please contact your Recruiter or Recruiting Coordinator directly. Requests for accommodation will be handled confidentially by Recruiting and will not be shared with the hiring manager. Jamf is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate against individuals who request reasonable accommodation for disability or religious beliefs. To request accommodations please email us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/jamf/inside-account-executive-smb-mea-existing-customers-amsterdam-62478","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1795470932},{"slug":"sales-account-executive-enterprise-107552","company_name":"zscaler","title":"Sales Account Executive - Enterprise","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 200+ public data centers globally and thousands of private sites at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for an Account Executive to join our team. This is a Hybrid role, reporting to the Regional Director in the Sales and Go-to-Market department. The Sales and Go-to-Market team is a global group of professionals who are passionate about delighting our customers, nurturing trusted partnerships, and driving a secure, cloud-enabled digital future. In this role, you will focus on expanding our footprint across the Dutch market, demonstrating the power and agility of cloud transformation to enterprise accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage an assigned territory focused on net new logo and upsell opportunities across the Dutch market within mixed verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue growth by selling into Enterprise level accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales Engineering, Solution Architecture, Value Consulting, and Transformation Teams throughout your sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working with enterprise technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building new logos from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience navigating and selling within the Dutch market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling a complex SaaS solution and leading complex sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and Dutch speaker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI-powered sales intelligence tools or positioning AI-driven cloud security architectures to enterprise clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cyber security experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-JP3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
